@startuml
' Report 4: supporting interaction
title FE-07-ADMIN-PROFILE - Admin views and edits another profile
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 170
skinparam ParticipantPadding 16
skinparam sequence {
 ArrowColor #202020
 LifeLineBorderColor #777777
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor #202020
 ActorBackgroundColor white
 ActorBorderColor #202020
 ActivationBackgroundColor white
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor #444444
 ReferenceBackgroundColor white
}
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFF0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #777777
actor "Admin" as U
participant "SSFM Interface" as UI
participant "UsersController" as C
participant "UsersService" as S
participant "PrismaService" as P
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
caption Existing + proposed extension - target design, not a claim of complete implementation
U -> UI : 1. View and update selected user profile
activate UI
UI -> C : 2. View and update selected user profile
activate C
' ref-target: REQUEST-CHECKS
ref over C : 3. Verify user, role and input\n(REQUEST-CHECKS)
alt 3.1 Request not allowed
C -->> UI : 3.1.1. Request rejected
else else
C -> S : 4. View and update selected user profile
activate S
note over S
Proposed extension: Admin profile editing.
end note
S -> P : 5. Load selected user
activate P
P -> DB : 6. Load selected user
activate DB
DB -->> P : 7. User or none
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 8. User or none
deactivate P
alt 8.1 Selected user not found
S -->> C : 8.1.1. User not found
else else
S -> P : 9. Save permitted profile changes
activate P
P -> DB : 10. Save permitted profile changes
activate DB
DB -->> P : 11. Updated profile
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 12. Updated profile
deactivate P
S -->> C : 13. Updated profile
end
deactivate S
C -->> UI : 14. Return result or error
end
deactivate C
UI -->> U : 15. Show result or error
deactivate UI
' Source references:
' backend/src/modules/users/users.controller.ts:22 UsersController
' backend/src/modules/users/users.service.ts:14 UsersService
' backend/src/prisma/prisma.service.ts:11 PrismaService
@enduml
